<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ml">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ishq Network | Rasool Vocal HQ Official</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;800&family=Manjari:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #090a0f;
            --card-bg: rgba(22, 27, 38, 0.7);
            --border-glow: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.3);
            --accent-purple: #9333ea;
            --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
            --accent-gold: #f59e0b;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Manjari', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%);
        }

        header {
            padding: 20px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--accent-gold) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .brand-tag {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .main-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .hero-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .bio-text {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px auto;
        }

        .nav-tabs {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tab-btn:hover, .tab-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-purple), var(--accent-cyan));
            border-color: transparent;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
        }

        .section-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .track-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .track-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .track-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .track-info h4 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .track-info p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .play-btn {
            background: var(--accent-purple);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 8px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .play-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-top: auto;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div>
            <div class="brand-logo">ISHQ NETWORK</div>
            <div class="brand-tag">Rasool Vocal HQ</div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="main-container">
        <div class="hero-card">
            <h1 class="hero-title">Rasool Vocal HQ</h1>
            <div class="hero-subtitle">Pure-Voice A Cappella & Hybrid Vocal Singing Method</div>
            <p class="bio-text">
                ഇഷ്ഖ് നെറ്റ്‌വർക്കിന്റെ (Ishq Network) കീഴിലുള്ള ഔദ്യോഗിക സംഗീത പോർട്ടൽ. വാദ്യോപകരണങ്ങളുടെ അകമ്പടിയില്ലാതെ ശുദ്ധമായ വോക്കൽ ഹാർമണികളും, പ്യുവർ അക്കാപെല്ല (Pure-voice A cappella) രീതിയിലുള്ള മാപ്പിളപ്പാട്ടുകളും മനോഹരമായ ആൽബം ഗാനങ്ങളും നിർമ്മിക്കുന്ന പോർട്ടൽ.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="section-card">
            <h3 class="section-title">🎵 പുതിയ റിലീസുകൾ (Latest Releases)</h3>
            <div class="track-list">
                <div class="track-item">
                    <div class="track-info">
                        <h4>പിരിഷം (Pirisham)</h4>
                        <p>Ishq Network Original • Pure Vocal Harmony</p>
                    </div>
                    <button class="play-btn">Play Track</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        © 2026 Ishq Network & Rasool Vocal HQ. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
